  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td style="width: 27px">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 24px"><span style="font-size: 10pt">2.</span></td>
    <td><span style="font-size: 10pt">Ratify the appointment of Baker Tilly US, LLP as our independent registered public accounting firm for our fiscal year ending March 31, 2024. The resolution was approved.</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

